<title>BELGIUM: OECD sees Luxembourg 97-98 growth rate around 4pct.</title>
<headline>OECD sees Luxembourg 97-98 growth rate around 4pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg should continue to enjoy a real GDP growth rate of around four percent in both 1997 and 1998, the Organisation for Economic Cooperation and Development (OECD) said on Thursday in its semi-annual report.</p>
</text>
